{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e5a9abaee343819ee70315fd4366b5642ab7732302010e9faff3efd8712818c8",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_b:2_4_011_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d74084ecb555179047be5461d685b7393872726913bcf73d4998d44b403a7e8d",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー？\n抱歉，现在方便说两句吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_b:2_4_011_02_09_b:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3114232fe53163e7e865b92ba0e38b3ac3cf77cbb674c33266b3ed0444921893",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_b:2_4_011_02_09_b:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a72164fcb21662657f48aa99cc56a95b9953361195fd9284d42d83dad10a0dd1",
      "text": "就是宿舍里要办的派对，\n大家决定纯手工制作南瓜灯来当装饰。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_b:2_4_011_02_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d6bd51797c8a8fae55c83b884bee9240c91b57eaf761577f775466a854d0d66",
      "text": "只是，感觉花的时间会比预想的要长，\n如果有支援的话就太感激了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_b:2_4_011_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd7e6b8fc2099998d80916fa44b81c23aee69ad53360b5b76f4fab07b6b81020",
      "text": "明天左右，会有\n谁正好有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_b:2_4_011_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:545e871b2b5a9bb28410bf28f939c720cf4834c2f82bf3cfa7f6178efda97d11",
      "text": "啊，恭二和皮埃尔那边我已经\n发过求助了就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_b:2_4_011_02_09_b:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ceb1c428a5ed6bbe96f30d92a9509111acebb7385ae1d27e6a7ccb2672db4cdc",
      "text": "我来\n帮忙吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_b:2_4_011_02_09_b:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4dd0ec086b17c7def0d0ec3f4e0f30d79403250e434772cb6bc8a9da9a5cfed",
      "text": "我正巧有空哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_b:2_4_011_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:490fc3e14b9db00872a3054999d1663128ab779b86d6917199e8217d7dd4ce6a",
      "text": "诶，可以吗？那可真是帮了大忙了，但没关系吗？\n明明你那么忙，真抱歉啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_b:2_4_011_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7850ad2f1597a35c5789ac5b0b4bad41884f2a0d803e82136f57d66c14845656",
      "text": "谢谢你。那就拜托你了哦。\n详情我晚点再发邮件给你，请多关照啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
